# Rivet core

- Project: **Rivet**. Packages: `rivet_pkg`, `rivet_uvm_pkg`.
- English only for code, comments, commits, docs.
- Terminology (locked):
  - **`rivet_pcie_ctrl`** — multi-mode soft controller (EP/RC/USP/DSP) to PIPE
  - **`rivet_pcie_phy_*`** — PG239 family PHY wrappers
  - **`rivet_pcie`** — full soft IP = ctrl + phy
- User IF on controller: AXI-ST CQ/CC/RQ/RC + `cfg_mgmt_*` (PG213-style); no AXI-Lite
- Current focus: `MODE=EP`, Gen2, `LANES` in {1,2,4}
- Phase 1: UVM environment first, then Gen2 link RTL (see `docs/roadmap.md`)
- Gen3/4 deltas: `docs/gen-evolution.md` — do not implement Gen3/4 protocol while Gen2 is active
- No vendor cells in `rtl/pcie_ctrl/`; PHY only under `rtl/phy/`
- Verification before features; no proprietary specs in-repo
- Commits: `feat|fix|test|docs|build|chore|refactor(scope): ...`
